cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If using this proof archive, please cite it."
title: "Common Minor Laws for Distinct-Support Givens Circuits and Alternating Rings"
authors:
  - given-names: Yongxian
    family-names: Zhang
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-28"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "For Givens circuits using each coordinate pair at most once, we classify exactly which ordered support graphs have a common all-orders minor law for every choice of gates. We also characterize alternating rings at fixed gates by a phase-sensitive Walsh feasibility test."
